WEBVTT

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.460
What organization are you bastards from?

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.460
Hey there, buddy! You find any notable intel?

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.170
You tell me.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:57.380
Why not ask the head of the 
house over there yourself?

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.460
I can give chase. Want me to?

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.080
No need to right now.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.710
Man, that guy's tough.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.710
If we're talking in terms of 
Status, he was your equal.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.710
How's Lord Elsnes?

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.130
He's dead.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.920
Mercy of an Assassin

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:33.750
The "canbells," inside which 
the city blocks are housed,

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:36.000
are connected by glass tubes.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:51.210
Humankind's last-standing city-state -
the world within the lantern - Flandore.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:55.290
Within the unending darkness outside,

00:01:56.250 --> 00:02:01.460
lurk monsters gnawed at away by
the night called "lancanthropes."

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.500
Feels like a brainy place.
Feels like a brainy place.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:50.790
We said the same exact thing!

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:53.170
Yeah, talk about a coincidence.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.460
Take my hand, milady.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.500
Wh-what a gentleman!

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:01.580
Th-thank you.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.880
It's only natural to show a little courtesy.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.500
I wish I could escort you all 
the way to your destination...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.460
Don't be silly!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.500
I'd been terribly anxious 
being all on my own...

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.170
So I'm glad to have met you!

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:23.420
I get the feeling everything's
gonna keep going smoothly for me!

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:25.080
I'm happy to hear that.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:27.540
Well then, I hope to run 
into you again sometime.

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.210
Yeah, see you later!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.000
Definitely, definitely meet up with me again!

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.330
See you!

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.330
Mr. Kufa Vampir, I presume?

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:28.790
Pleased to meet you.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.330
I look forward to working alongside you.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.960
I'm Aimee, the head maid of this residence.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.920
Likewise, I'm looking forward 
to working alongside you.

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:41.080
Well then, allow me to show 
you around the mansion.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.290
Starting today, this is where you'll
be working for the next three years.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:59.250
I believe milady is already waiting for...

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.250
Oh?

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.380
L-Lady Melida?!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.250
Are you alright, milady?

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.580
A-are you my instructor?

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:23.380
Yes. The name is Kufa.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.830
I look forward to spending the 
next three years together.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:29.540
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:30.380
Milady!
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:31.170
Milady!
You really shocked me!

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:31.500
You really shocked me!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.380
Any injuries?

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.500
N-nice to meet you, Instructor.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.960
My name is Melida Angel.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.040
Milady, it's time to get 
going to the academy.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:01.750
Please get ready.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:06.790
Kufa, please look after milady,
even while she's attending the academy.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:10.250
Huh? Y-you'll be coming 
with me to the academy?

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:13.000
Yes. Were you unaware of that?

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.920
Milady, while I am in charge of your instruction,
I am also your attendant,

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.710
so I have received special
permission to enter the grounds.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:33.880
You're finally here!

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.420
You're late, you know, Melida.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.500
G-good morning, Nerva.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.170
I thought you were playing hooky.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.000
And who might he be?

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:51.380
Ah... He's my private tutor, 
who has just arrived today.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:54.670
Hmm... Is he going to instruct 
you in your studies?

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:56.380
Or...

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.290
in the use of mana?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.290
W-well...

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.830
Oh, dear!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.460
We don't have time to 
waste talking like this.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.750
Right, Melida?

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.960
Come and be my training partner.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:16.000
A power that grants various 
unusual talents to its users

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:20.210
and elevates their physical abilities
beyond those of ordinary humans...

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.130
"mana."

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:25.540
It is a gift that has been granted
to only the chosen noble class.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.710
Generally speaking, this power
awakens around the age of seven.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.420
Oh... She has beautiful form.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.380
While she was born into the House of Angel,

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.960
with its title of "Paladin" as one of
the three big aristocratic Houses...

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.380
she has been unable to manifest any mana
whatsoever up through this very day.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:57.380
An incompetent talented girl.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:10.880
That is the limitation of 
the mana-less Melida Angel.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.380
Hey, Melida.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.960
You going to be able to 
achieve your dream like that?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.330
Oh, she has a dream?

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.130
Whatever are you talking about, Nerva.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:25.580
I hear that from a young age it's been
this girl's dream to join Crest Legion

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.130
and become the people's sword of hope!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:30.830
When I learned it was the much-talked-about

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:32.920
"incompetent talented girl" 
who was saying such a thing,

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.070
I found it quite amusing...

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:39.380
How funny!

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:51.580
Oh, right, the new tutor Elise secured for herself
is an elite member of Crest Legion, you know?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.540
You're here, huh, Elli...

00:09:55.500 --> 00:10:00.250
We are talking about Elise,
who ages ago awakened her Paladin class,

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.830
so if she receives guidance 
from a tutor like that...

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:06.420
she'll end up joining Crest 
Legion in no time, you know?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:11.830
I...

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:17.040
Having been born into a branch
family of an aristocratic House,

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.540
that is Lady Melida's cousin...

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.830
Elise Angel, huh?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.670
Why're you coming chasing after me?!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.630
You're also gonna tell me there's
no way I can do it, right?!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.790
You know, Lita, I-

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.290
Don't be all friendly calling 
me "Lita" like that!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:39.000
This incompetent talentless girl's goal is to join
Crest Legion, the most eminent guild.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.880
What a bad joke that is.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:50.960
Lady Melida's grandfather, Lord Mordrew,
has doubts as to whether Melida,

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:54.290
who has yet to awaken the power of mana,
is a true child of the House of Angel.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:12:01.750
So, you mean to say that Lord Elsnes had an
affair with Lady Melida's mother, Lady Melinoa?

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.460
Tough to say.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.210
We're left in the dark now 
that he's ended up like this.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:08.500
And so...

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:11.710
that means it's finally your 
turn to spring into action!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:12.670
Hm?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.630
Your first mission is as follows:

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.130
Become Lady Melida Angel's 
private tutor, guide her,

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:23.330
and foster her into a battle maiden
befitting of an aristocratic House.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:26.290
If approaching it from the outside isn't
working, go at it from the inside, eh?

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:31.710
So, you see, the use of a specialist
instructor has become necessary now.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:40.880
I've now observed her for a full day, and I see
no sign of Melida Angel possessing any aptitude.

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:47.210
Conclusion: She is not the biological
daughter of the knight-duke, Felgus Angel.

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:53.880
Consequently, I will carry out my second
mission: the assassination of Melida Angel.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.040
Properly speaking, the deed 
shouldn't be done so soon.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:01.710
Nevertheless...

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:04.830
I can't stomach watching Melida Angel.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:08.060
A child who's the product of a mother who,

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:10.320
although vastly wealthy, 
came from the commoner class

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:12.540
and the man with whom she had an affair.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:18.420
She may boast the Angel family name,
but she lacks the qualities to be a Paladin.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:25.290
Without knowing any of that,
she straightforwardly believes in her own talents.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.500
What a pitiful girl.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:33.130
Her life is full of suffering.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.630
And she will continue to keep on suffering.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:41.880
The day that all suffering is
finally rewarded will never come.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:47.630
That being the case, promptly severing
that chain of events is called for.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.670
It's the mercy of a professional killer...

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:53.880
an assassin's pride.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.540
I'm not picking up her presence?!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:33.040
What the hell's with you guys?!

00:14:49.920 --> 00:14:50.880
This anima...!

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:10.630
Lancanthropes?!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.750
Why're they in a city block 
on a layer this high up?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:18.810
I hear Lord Mordrew often 
tries to pressure her,

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.340
but it apparently never 
produces a positive effect.

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:24.330
So this is that pressure...

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:28.960
So he intends to awaken her mana
by forcing her into combat, eh?

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.710
You little...!

00:16:02.880 --> 00:16:04.500
Why doesn't she call for help?

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:09.790
Stop that! Don't touch my hair!

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.960
Hands off! Let go of it!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.500
It's something I remember my mother by!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:18.330
My departed mother had the same blond hair.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:23.380
If it's taken away from me,
I'll no longer be able to recall my mother!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.500
If she was to call for help,

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.040
a guild out on patrol 
would rush to the scene.

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.000
They'd easily dispatch these 
lowest of lancanthropes.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.080
So, why then...?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.920
I have to treasure and 
take good care of my hair!

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:39.040
I have to join the ranks of Crest Legion!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.170
Otherwise...

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.790
No one will even acknowledge...

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:48.080
that I'm a child of the House of Angel.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:53.960
So she doesn't call for help because doing so
would mean she doesn't possess any mana,

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:58.920
and it would be seen as her admitting she's
not a child of the House of Angel... huh?

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:02.880
Aah, it truly is...

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.250
a bad joke.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:17.710
Don't lay a finger on my employer.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:22.290
"Save me"...?

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:25.330
What made you think you could 
come out of this alive?

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.500
Phantom-Blade Trident...

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.710
Void Fang!

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.500
Instructor...?

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:08.130
I'm sorry it took me so 
long to get here, milady.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.330
I-it's no problem.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:18.790
I'm sorry for having caused you trouble.

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:21.250
Oh, I see...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.710
She's always on her own.

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.460
I'd like to see it with my own two eyes...

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:31.750
The moment this precious girl,
who's been fighting with all she's got in this cruel world,

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.580
is someday acknowledged.

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:43.170
Milady, please allow me, 
at least, to save you.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.710
I want to lend you my support.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.880
No matter the storm you may find yourself in,

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:55.380
I will not fail to respond to your call.

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:06.130
Milady, will you entrust me with your life?

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:13.210
It's a risky gamble, but there is one -
and only one - way to awaken your mana.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.380
There's no guarantee it 
will be successful, though.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:21.830
If it fails, beyond just lasting aftereffects,
it may even result in death.

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.670
I can't force you to go through with it.

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:26.920
What will it be?

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:38.330
I'll do it.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:50.080
My Little Lady.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:04.080
Milady, just as you have entrusted your life to me,
I have staked my life on you.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.540
Look, Instructor!

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:16.710
Amazing! Simply amazing, Lady Melida!

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:19.880
Whenever did you become 
able to do such a thing?!

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:22.580
Milady has at long last used mana!

00:22:27.170 --> 00:22:30.960
Aimee, Grace, Nietzsche, Myra...

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:34.710
I'm sorry for causing you all
nothing but worry for so long.

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:41.630
If you hadn't all been here,
I couldn't have endured until now.

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:43.670
Thank you.

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:49.040
Alright! Tonight, we're 
having a party to celebrate.

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:50.420
Party!

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:57.170
Well... I suppose there's 
no turning back now.

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:01.960
I can't let milady know about 
her mother's illicit affair.

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:05.710
And, of course, me being an
assassin must remain a secret.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:11.880
At the same time, I must conceal her true lineage
and the substantial support I'm giving her

00:23:12.460 --> 00:23:18.790
from our client, Lord Mordrew,
and from my guild, White Night.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:25.330
If I err in regard to any of this,
both of us will be meet an instant death.

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:34.630
So, please, My Little Lady,
don't make me have to kill you, okay?

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:40.790
Next Episode
When the Girl's World Changes
